<title>USA: U.S. cocoa bean, product imports - Commerce.</title>
<headline>U.S. cocoa bean, product imports - Commerce.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Commerce report of cocoa bean and cocoa product imports, in tonnes:</p>
<p>			Aug96   July96    Aug95</p>
<p> Cocoa Beans-X   17,859   29,437   21,226</p>
<p>Cocoa Paste --</p>
<p> - Not Defatted   1,715    1,077    2,209</p>
<p> - Defatted	 3,776    3,121    1,928</p>
<p> Cocoa Butter-Y   6,640    9,388    3,049</p>
<p> Cocoa Powder     7,397    6,185    7,772</p>
<p>Note-Cocoa products contain no sugar or milk products. X-Whole or broken, raw or roasted. Y-Includes fat and oil.</p>
</text>
